Z||000006||mike tatara||09-11-2001||10:50 PM||||hi kasdan<P>im doing a 3800sc   check the web its probably the easiest and most popular<BR>better engine availabilty  lower service costs  bolts right to your fiero tranny<BR>need flywheel mod  of course    use same tranny mounts  modify frt mount and add some form of torque control  check out various fiero links you can buy kits or go it alone<P>good luck||||reg||1
